69
00:13:42.170 --> 00:14:01.229
Lazar Petrovic: Essentially, it is just keeping track of all transactions that we actually need to reach consensus on, and put in a block and get a signed block on. If none such transactions exist, we can stop

70
00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:08.309
Lazar Petrovic: … We can stop, creating events, thus We will stop producing blocks.

71
00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:20.569
Lazar Petrovic: And we'll be using much less bandwidth and hard disk space and so on and so forth. There are a few other, details there. So.

72
00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:33.099
Lazar Petrovic: A certain functionality kind of needs the network to be active, otherwise it doesn't work, so we need consensus time to advance, for example, for scheduled transactions.

73
00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:35.190
Lazar Petrovic: That is, …

74
00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:50.419
Lazar Petrovic: or for freeze, or anything that is reliant on consensus time, that will require the network to stop quiescing. And so, essentially.

75
00:14:50.900 --> 00:15:06.929
Lazar Petrovic: all the nodes in the network will have the same view into what the current situation is. So, either we have transactions that haven't reached consensus and ended up in a block that has been signed by the whole network that we can get state proofs on.

76
00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.350
Lazar Petrovic: Or no.

77
00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:16.890
Lazar Petrovic: If there are none, Everybody can stop. They can just keep gossiping in case something shows up.

78
00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:25.219
Lazar Petrovic: … And so, a node might receive a transaction, it will create an event.

79
00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:39.979
Lazar Petrovic: put it into, … it will create an event, put that transaction into an event, gossip it to everyone else. At this point, the whole network becomes aware of this transaction that needs to reach consensus and end up in a fully signed block.

80
00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:44.510
Lazar Petrovic: And it will, stop quiescing.

81
00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:58.500
Lazar Petrovic: Until, all of that is processed, we've reached consensus, we sign the block, those signatures are gossiped throughout the network, everybody has aggregated them, and… and then we can quies again.

